# Dependencies & logs
node_modules/
*.log

# Generated eval outputs & reports.
#
# ROOT ONLY. A bare `*.html` also caught web/index.html — Vite's entry point, and the one
# file without which `npm run web` cannot start — so the browser dashboard did not build on
# a clean clone while every other file under web/ was tracked. Reports are written here, at
# the top level; source HTML lives in an app directory and is not this pattern's business.
eval/
/*.html

# Working notes and exploratory artifacts. One directory instead of a rule per filename:
# the old arrangement meant every new scratch file needed a line here, and the ones nobody
# added showed up as untracked noise in `git status`.
scratch/

# Kept at the repository root on purpose, and ignored by name rather than moved:
# `shock_siagnostic_test.md` is cited as evidence of record in PRODUCT.md, and report.html
# is the root-level report surface PRODUCT.md specifies (already covered by /*.html above).
shock_siagnostic_test.md

# Editor / tool artifacts
.claude/
.impeccable/
.env
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# TypeScript / test artifacts
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/

# Web dashboard (own Vite app under web/)
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
